title square screen: a card with a Mic boost, the MIC BOOST stepper in CARD's slot
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BOOST 1
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
expect text "MIC BOOST"
expect notext "CARD"
expect text "+20 dB"
shot boost-slot
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
